cff-version: 1.2.0
title: scIngest
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and also cite
  Seurat, Scanpy, and AnnData, together with the original study behind
  any GEO accession you processed.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Saikat
    email: saikatbib@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/PENDING/scingest"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform desktop application that builds Seurat and Scanpy
  objects from GEO accessions and local 10x directories, with automatic
  format detection, a mandatory human confirmation step, and a full
  provenance record.
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
